        ],
        "description": "<div style=\"text-align:Left;\"><div><div><p>Department of Health and Human Services (DHHS) licensed Child Care and Preschools in Nebraska. Static lists will be acquired from the DHHS Division of Public Health (DPH) Licensure (LIC) Unit monthly. The feature service will be updated monthly, on or around the 15th of each month, or on an as needed basis. Due to the nature of the updates caution should be used when accessing the data each month from the 15th to the 17th. Examination of the attribute fields and metadata will provide more information. For specific questions about updates and update status please consult the metadata, then contact DHHS.GIS@nebraska.gov. For specific questions about license and location contact DHHS Licensure.</p></div></div></div>",
        "licenseInfo": "<div style=\"text-align:Left;\"><div><div><p>Data was designed to be used in Nebraska Department of Health and Human Services GIS applications and shared for public use on NebraskaMap.gov. Data is subject to change without notice. Extra caution should be used around the scheduled update.</p></div></div></div>",
