          "Web Map"
        ],
        "description": "<div style='background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255); border:0px solid currentcolor; box-sizing:border-box; color:rgb(74, 74, 74); font-family:&quot;Avenir Next&quot;, Avenir, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-size:16px; font-style:normal; font-variant-caps:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; font-weight:400; letter-spacing:normal; line-height:1.5; text-align:start; text-decoration-color:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-indent:0px; text-transform:none; word-spacing:0px;'><span style='color:rgb(47,79,79); font-family:inherit; font-size:14px;'><span style='border:0px solid currentcolor; box-sizing:border-box; line-height:1.5;'>The Rural Health Transformation Program (RHTP) is a $50 billion federal opportunity to improve health care in rural areas across the 50 states.&nbsp;</span></span></div><div style='background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255); border:0px solid currentcolor; box-sizing:border-box; color:rgb(74, 74, 74); font-family:&quot;Avenir Next&quot;, Avenir, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-size:16px; font-style:normal; font-variant-caps:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; font-weight:400; letter-spacing:normal; line-height:1.5; text-align:start; text-decoration-color:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-indent:0px; text-transform:none; word-spacing:0px;'><span style='color:rgb(47,79,79); font-family:inherit; font-size:14px;'><span style='border:0px solid currentcolor; box-sizing:border-box; line-height:1.5;'>RHTP is a once-in-a-generation opportunity to modernize rural health care and make it more sustainable. Nebraska received $218.5 million from the Centers for Medicare &amp; Medicaid Services (CMS) for the first year of a five-year program.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span></div><div style='background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255); border:0px solid currentcolor; box-sizing:border-box; color:rgb(74, 74, 74); font-family:&quot;Avenir Next&quot;, Avenir, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-size:16px; font-style:normal; font-variant-caps:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; font-weight:400; letter-spacing:normal; line-height:1.5; text-align:start; text-decoration-color:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-indent:0px; text-transform:none; word-spacing:0px;'>&nbsp;</div><div style='background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255); border:0px solid currentcolor; box-sizing:border-box; color:rgb(74, 74, 74); font-family:&quot;Avenir Next&quot;, Avenir, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-size:16px; font-style:normal; font-variant-caps:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; font-weight:400; letter-spacing:normal; line-height:1.5; text-align:start; text-decoration-color:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-indent:0px; text-transform:none; word-spacing:0px;'><span style='color:rgb(47,79,79); font-family:inherit; font-size:14px;'><span style='border:0px solid currentcolor; box-sizing:border-box; line-height:1.5;'>This dashboard includes three tabs:&nbsp;</span></span></div><ol><li><div style='border:0px solid currentcolor; box-sizing:border-box; font-family:inherit; line-height:1.5;'><span style='color:rgb(47,79,79); font-family:inherit; font-size:14px;'><span style='border:0px solid currentcolor; box-sizing:border-box; line-height:1.5;'><strong>RHTP Awarded Map</strong></span></span></div><div style='border:0px solid currentcolor; box-sizing:border-box; font-family:inherit; line-height:1.5;'><span style='background-color:rgb(255,255,255); color:rgb(47,79,79); font-family:inherit; font-size:14px;'><span style='border:0px solid currentcolor; box-sizing:border-box; font-style:normal; font-variant-caps:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; font-weight:400; letter-spacing:normal; line-height:1.5; text-align:left; text-decoration-color:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-indent:0px; text-transform:none; word-spacing:0px;'>The </span></span><a style='background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255); border:0px solid currentcolor; box-sizing:border-box; color:rgb(48, 120, 144); font-family:&quot;Avenir Next&quot;, sans-serif, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;; font-size:17px; font-style:normal; font-variant-caps:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; font-weight:400; letter-spacing:normal; line-height:1.5; text-align:left; text-decoration:none; text-indent:0px; text-transform:none; word-spacing:0px;' target='_self'><span style='color:rgb(47,79,79); font-family:inherit; font-size:14px;'><span style='border:0px solid currentcolor; box-sizing:border-box; line-height:1.5;'>RHTP Awarded Map page</span></span></a><span style='background-color:rgb(255,255,255); color:rgb(47,79,79); font-family:inherit; font-size:14px;'><span style='border:0px solid currentcolor; box-sizing:border-box; font-style:normal; font-variant-caps:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; font-weight:400; letter-spacing:normal; line-height:1.5; text-align:left; text-decoration-color:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-indent:0px; text-transform:none; word-spacing:0px;'> contains data through July 7, 2026. The values presented do not represent awarded amounts directly assigned to each boundary. Instead, they are aggregated from awarded amounts assigned to subrecipients and vendors located within each boundary.</span></span></div></li><li><div style='border:0px solid currentcolor; box-sizing:border-box; font-family:inherit; line-height:1.5;'><span style='color:rgb(47,79,79); font-family:inherit; font-size:14px;'><span style='border:0px solid currentcolor; box-sizing:border-box; line-height:1.5;'><strong>Healthcare Facility and License Type Location Map</strong></span></span></div><p style='border:0px solid currentcolor; box-sizing:border-box; margin:0px; padding:0px;'><span style='font-family:inherit; font-size:14px;'><span style='border:0px solid currentcolor; box-sizing:border-box; line-height:1.5;'>Selected healthcare facility types of facility and license location maps with 30-/60-/90-minute driving travel times.</span></span></p></li>